    kind: invariant  # 64f7
    title: "package-level call sites emit no calls edge in rust/java/kotlin/swift/ruby/c/cpp/scala/lua (fixture-proven, INV-nopoh's family); csharp also drops every unresolved callee"  # 64f7
    status: violated  # 64f7
    priority: 2  # 64f7
    parent:  # 64f7
    tags:  # 64f7
